### Health + headers
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/health

### SQLi regression: value must be treated as text, not SQL code
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/events?q=' OR '1'='1&sort=createdAt&order=DESC&limit=5

### IDOR: no current user -> 401
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/events/1

### IDOR: wrong user -> 403 if event belongs to another author
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/events/1
Content-Type: application/json
X-Demo-UserId: 2

{
  "description": "Спроба чужого редагування"
}

### Legitimate update: use owner id in X-Demo-UserId
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/v1/events/1
Content-Type: application/json
X-Demo-UserId: 1

{
  "description": "Легітимне оновлення автором"
}

### XSS regression: text must render as text in UI
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/events
Content-Type: application/json
X-Demo-UserId: 1

{
  "title": "XSS перевірка",
  "description": "<b>перевірка</b>",
  "category": "announcement",
  "author_id": 1
}
